4:["$","article",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-12 sm:px-8","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap gap-2","children":[["$","span","GST",{"className":"rounded-full bg-white/8 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-200","children":"GST"}],["$","span","CGST",{"className":"rounded-full bg-white/8 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-200","children":"CGST"}],["$","span","SGST",{"className":"rounded-full bg-white/8 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-200","children":"SGST"}],["$","span","IGST",{"className":"rounded-full bg-white/8 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-200","children":"IGST"}]]}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-5 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl","children":"CGST, SGST and IGST Explained for Small Businesses in India"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300","children":"Understand CGST, SGST and IGST with simple examples, GST invoice format tips, place of supply rules, FAQs and GST calculator links."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500","children":["18 May 2026"," · ",14," min read · ","InvoiceWala Team"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-10","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-invert max-w-none prose-headings:tracking-tight prose-a:text-cyan-300","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"# CGST, SGST and IGST Explained for Small Businesses in India"}]]}],["$","p","1",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"CGST, SGST and IGST are three GST components that decide how tax is shown on Indian GST invoices. For small businesses, freelancers, consultants, contractors, agencies and shops, the confusing part is not usually the GST rate. The confusing part is deciding whether the invoice should show CGST plus SGST or IGST."}]]}],["$","p","2",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The short answer is simple: if the supplier location and place of supply are in the same state, the transaction is generally intra-state and CGST plus SGST applies. If they are in different states, the transaction is generally inter-state and IGST applies. Official CBIC material explains that GST follows a place-of-supply principle and that IGST is levied on inter-state supply. You can review official references from "}],["$","a","1",{"className":"font-semibold text-cyan-300 underline-offset-2 hover:underline","href":"https://cbic-gst.gov.in/about-gst.html","rel":"noreferrer","target":"_blank","children":"CBIC's GST overview"}],["$","span","2",{"children":" and the "}],["$","a","3",{"className":"font-semibold text-cyan-300 underline-offset-2 hover:underline","href":"https://services.india.gov.in/service/detail/check-gst-rates","rel":"noreferrer","target":"_blank","children":"Government Services GST rate page"}],["$","span","4",{"children":"."}]]}],["$","p","3",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"This article explains CGST, SGST and IGST in practical language with invoice examples, tables, checklists, mistakes and FAQs. It is written for business owners who create invoices, not for tax experts. For edge cases such as exports, SEZ, imports, specific services, branch transfers or unusual place-of-supply situations, confirm with your CA or tax advisor."}]]}],["$","h2","4",{"className":"mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-white","children":"Quick Answer: CGST vs SGST vs IGST"}],["$","div","5",{"className":"mt-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-white/10","children":["$","table",null,{"className":"w-full min-w-[480px] text-left text-sm","children":"$L9"}]}],"$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f","$L30","$L31","$L32","$L33","$L34","$L35","$L36","$L37","$L38","$L39","$L3a","$L3b","$L3c","$L3d","$L3e","$L3f","$L40","$L41","$L42","$L43","$L44","$L45","$L46","$L47","$L48","$L49","$L4a","$L4b","$L4c","$L4d","$L4e","$L4f","$L50","$L51"]}]}],"$L52"]}]
